#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: openmu-wp-connect.php
#: includes/settings.php:69
#: includes/settings.php:109
msgid "OpenMU WP Connect"
msgstr "OpenMU WP Connect"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: openmu-wp-connect.php
msgid "https://github.com/nolt/openmu-wp-connect"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: openmu-wp-connect.php
msgid "Blocks that show live data from an OpenMU game server through its website API: server status, character ranking, mini game rankings, event schedule, the armory and a player account. The site never touches the game database. Until the API is connected the blocks show demo data."
msgstr "Bloki z danymi na żywo z serwera gry OpenMU przez jego API dla stron: status serwera, ranking postaci, rankingi mini gier, harmonogram eventów, zbrojownia i konto gracza. Strona nigdy nie dotyka bazy gry. Dopóki API nie jest podłączone, bloki pokazują dane demonstracyjne."

